s://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/80/fuxs94d0e8zds5g3t9xjveakf0spxjh.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E6%98%9F%E6%A0%B8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/80/fuxs94d0e8zds5g3t9xjveakf0spxjh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />灵感星核\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"失焦\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">失焦</font></span></span>]。不受任何增益、减益、光环影响，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫行为异常\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫行为异常</font></span></span>]，免疫各种受到伤害加成效果。<br />✦被友军攻击时，自身被视为敌人，若为&lt;铃兰之剑&gt;阵营，受到的伤害值<font color=\"#ed7950\">30</font>%转移为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感指数\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感指数</font></span></span>]（不会造成实际伤害）；其他友军转移比例减半。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%81%B5%E6%84%9F%E6%98%9F%E6%A0%B8\" title=\"角色图鉴库/灵感星核\"><img alt=\"头像 灵感星核.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/50/ebfwcpy4c7y2ey67hogogbjmxsk1ym0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">灵感星核</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"失焦\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">失焦</font></span></span>]。不受任何增益、减益、光环影响，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫行为异常\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免疫行为异常</font></span></span>]，免疫各种受到伤害加成效果。<br />✦被友军攻击时，自身被视为敌人，若为&lt;铃兰之剑&gt;阵营，受到的伤害值<font color=\"#ed7950\">30</font>%转移为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感指数\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感指数</font></span></span>]（不会造成实际伤害）；其他友军转移比例减半。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%